{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.mi_sw_cartan_reduction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.mi_sw_cartan_reduction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.mi_sw_cartan_reduction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.mi_sw_cartan_reduction","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L126-L149","doc":"**Lemma (conditional on the geometric inputs above)**\n([`lem:mi-sw-abelianisation-cartan`]): *Cartan reduction recovers\nthe Seiberg–Witten differential.*\n\nUnder the weight-space abelianisation and the two local\nidentifications carried by `MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses`, the\nreduced connection **is** the Cartan embedding of `X • dz`\n(trivialisation + abelianisation, clauses 1–2), and its Cartan\ncomponent **is** the Seiberg–Witten differential (clause 3,\n`A⁰ = X·dz = λ_SW`).\n\nDerived, not projected: the first conjunct composes the proved\nhelper `eq_cartanEmbed_of_offdiag_zero` with the local form; the\nsecond composes the two local identifications by transitivity.\nNeither conjunct is a class field (§3b-cond item 5). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:mi-sw-abelianisation-cartan","label":"lem:mi-sw-abelianisation-cartan","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/mi-sw-abelianisation-cartan.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.sw_eq_local_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.sw_eq_local_form","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L124-L124","doc":"Defining property of the SW differential on the spectral\ncurve: `λ_SW = X • dz`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.cartan_local_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.cartan_local_form","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L121-L121","doc":"Local computation: the Cartan component is `X • dz` in the\nchart (Higgs-eigenvalue input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.abelianised_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.abelianised_minus","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L118-L118","doc":"Abelianisation: the lowering component vanishes on `𝒮_c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.abelianised_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.abelianised_plus","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L116-L116","doc":"Abelianisation: the raising component vanishes on `𝒮_c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.lambdaSW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.lambdaSW","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L114-L114","doc":"The Seiberg–Witten differential `λ_SW`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.dz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.dz","kind":"def","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L112-L112","doc":"The local coordinate `1`-form `dz` on `𝒮_c ≅ ℙ¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.X","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.X","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L110-L110","doc":"The color coordinate `X` (Higgs-field eigenvalue on the single\nsheet of the spectral curve over `𝒮_c`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.A","kind":"def","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L107-L107","doc":"The restriction `A|_{𝒮_c}` of the reduced connection, in the\nweight-space decomposition (clause 1's trivialised form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses.mk","kind":"ctor","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L103-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.MiSwCartanReductionHypotheses","kind":"class","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L79-L124","doc":"**§3b-cond hypothesis class** for\n[`lem:mi-sw-abelianisation-cartan`]: the geometric inputs of the\nCartan-reduction lemma on the exceptional divisor\n`𝒮_c ≅ ℙ¹(ℂ)`.\n\nFields are genuine *hypotheses* (never the conclusion):\n\n* `abelianised_plus` / `abelianised_minus` — the off-diagonal\n  weight components of the reduced connection vanish on `𝒮_c`\n  (weight-space abelianisation; narrative clause 2);\n* `cartan_local_form` — the local Higgs-eigenvalue computation:\n  in the coordinate chart the Cartan component is `X • dz`, where\n  `X` is the color coordinate cut out on the single spectral-curve\n  sheet over `𝒮_c` (open geometric input; not in Mathlib);\n* `sw_eq_local_form` — the Seiberg–Witten differential is the\n  tautological form `X • dz` on the spectral curve (its defining\n  property, recorded as a hypothesis on the opaque `lambdaSW`).\n\nThe conclusion `A⁰ = X·dz = λ_SW` plus the structural\ntrivialisation statement is *derived* in\n`mi_sw_cartan_reduction` below.  No instance is declared —\nfabricating one would be the §3b-tax violation; the open content\nis the existence of an instance for the Bring-surface geometry. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.eq_cartanEmbed_of_offdiag_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.eq_cartanEmbed_of_offdiag_zero","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L68-L77","doc":"**Helper (proved).**  A weight-decomposed form whose off-diagonal\ncomponents vanish *is* the Cartan embedding of its Cartan\ncomponent.  This is the abelianisation step of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.cartanEmbed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.cartanEmbed","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L62-L66","doc":"The abelian (Cartan) embedding: a `U(1)`-valued `1`-form `ω`\nviewed as the `𝔰𝔲(2)`-valued form `ω ⊗ H` with vanishing\noff-diagonal weight components. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.minus","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The lowering (`E₋`) component `A⁻`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.plus","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The raising (`E₊`) component `A⁺`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.cartan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.cartan","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The Cartan (`H`-weight-`0`) component `A⁰`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.WeightDecomposedForm","kind":"structure","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/mi_sw_cartan_reduction.lean#L49-L60","doc":"An `𝔰𝔲(2)`-valued `1`-form recorded in the weight-space\ndecomposition `A = A⁰ ⊗ H + A⁺ ⊗ E₊ + A⁻ ⊗ E₋`:\nthe three components are the coefficients of the standard\ngenerators `H, E₊, E₋`.  `Ω` is the (additive) group of scalar\n`1`-forms on the exceptional divisor. ","signatureChunk":0}]}